[2025-04-15 21:52:24,329][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-24 << "[0x9][0x9]<title>When Getting Phished Puts You in Mortal Danger</title>[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:52:24,329][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-24 << "[0x9][0x9]<link>https://krebsonsecurity.com/2025/03/when-getting-phished-puts-you-in-mortal-danger/</link>[\n]"
