[2025-04-15 21:52:28,357][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-46 << "<li>ICSA-25-105-03 <a href="https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/ics-advisories/icsa-25-105-03">Siemens SIMOCODE, SIMATIC, SIPLUS, SIDOOR, SIWAREX</a>[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:52:28,357][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-46 << "</li>[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:52:28,357][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-46 << "<li>ICSA-25-105-04 <a href="https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/ics-advisories/icsa-25-105-04">Growatt Cloud Applications</a>[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:52:28,357][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-46 << "</li>[\n]"
