[2025-04-15 21:52:32,147][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-67 << "                                    Hacktivists targeting crit"
[2025-04-15 21:52:32,148][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-67 << "ical infrastructure increasingly resemble state-backed actors rather than independent activists. Groups like CyberArmyofRussia_Reborn1 and BlackJack have sophisticated capabilities and strategic timing that suggest government connections.[\n]"
